help_play = How to play
help_play_1 = • **Swipe** up, down, left, or right to slide every tile that way; on a keyboard, use the arrow keys.
help_play_2 = • When two tiles with the **same number** collide, they merge into one tile with their **sum**.
help_play_3 = • After every move, a new **2** (or sometimes **4**) appears on a random empty cell.
help_goal = Goal
help_goal_1 = Create a **2048** tile to win. After winning, you can keep going for a higher score.
help_over_1 = The game ends when the board is full and no two adjacent tiles match.
help_tips = Tips
help_tips_1 = • Pick a corner and keep your largest tile parked there.
help_tips_2 = • Build merges in a single direction so smaller tiles line up underneath your big one.
help_tips_3 = • On Easy, **undo** is available. Use it to recover from a mistake.
